    narr:narration """This narrative hub centers on the [explicit positioning](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat) of the product as a [structured async decision platform](narr:Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform), a category defined specifically in opposition to real-time chat tools like Slack or Teams. The initial vision, established in March 2026, targets [remote teams of 10-50 people](narr:Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams) who experience significant decision-loss. While the [foundational pricing](narr:Position_PricingTwelveDollars) was set at $12 per user, a subsequent retro in late March 2026 introduced a tiered adjustment to $15 for larger teams, signaling an early shift in monetization strategy. Recent activity reflects a move toward operationalizing these goals, evidenced by the [shipping of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_1) in August 2026, which transitions the project from conceptual positioning into concrete feature delivery.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_PricingTwelveDollars> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Real-time chat (Slack, Teams) is the named anti-pattern." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Structured async decision platform" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "remote teams with 10-50 people" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We shipped the async decision widget." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_1> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The pricing model evolved from a flat $12 rate to a tiered $15 structure for teams over 25, suggesting a pivot toward enterprise-scale monetization." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_PricingTwelveDollars> ] ;
    narr:writer "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite" .
